61kd.jpg"}], "slug": "monster-breeder-battler", "summary": "Monster Breeder Battler is a factory-building and tower defense hybrid. Players build a production line on their ranch, using spawn pens, conveyor belts, berry feeders, Element Baths, trainers and groupers to breed and buff monsters, which then march up into a lane to defend the ranch wall against shadow waves emerging from a rift. The game features 65 breedable species across ten tiers, grown from four starters through a 61-recipe breeding tree, and four elements: Ember, Frost, Terra and Volt. Monster deaths are permanent. Between rounds, players see a preview of the next wave and can rebuild against it, draft perks, unlock nodes in a four-branch research tree, and spend boss drops in the Forge. The campaign consists of three fifteen-round hunts, each ending in a fight against a warlord.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/monster-breeder-battler"}